      16,
      32,
      64,
      128
     ],
     "h_nominal": [
      0.125,
      0.0625,
      0.03125,
      0.015625,
      0.0078125
     ],
     "construction": "f1a_stokes_check.structured_mesh(N): the N = 8 BASE mesh (8 x 8 squares split along the (1,1) diagonal, except the two cells at the corners (1,0) and (0,1), split the other way: no triangle with all vertices on the boundary) refined uniformly (red) log2(N/8) times. Nested; the flipped region of level N is a (N/8) x (N/8) block at each of those corners. The check module verifies counts, hash and nestedness.",
     "h_definition": "h_nominal = 1/N (leg of the right triangles); h_max = sqrt(2)/N reported too",
     "periodic": "x: nodes on x=0 and x=1 identified"
    }
   },
   "pressure_drop_per_period": 2.0,
   "flow_rate_Q": "sin(2)/250 + 1/50",
   "shared_node_rule": "At a velocity node shared by several boundary attributes: (1) Dirichlet beats every natural condition (traction, do-nothing) and every slip/symmetry constraint (the slip constraint is not imposed at such nodes); (2) between Dirichlet attributes the fixed data AGREE at shared nodes (checked: dirichlet_shared_node_mismatch_max), so no precedence between them is needed and the result is independent of attribute order; (3) between two slip/symmetry attributes both normal constraints are imposed (u = 0 at a convex corner); (4) a periodic pair at a Dirichlet corner takes the (periodic-consistent) Dirichlet value."
  }
 },
